{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Hell Yeah!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotten is a 2D top-down shooter with roguelike elements where you fight hordes of enemies using a huge variety of weapons and modifiers. Be free to create crazy synergies and combinations to become stronger every round!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">70+ Different modifiers (upgrades)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clearing a round grants you the chance of choosing a modifier! Modifiers are stackable upgrades that can change the way you play the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Akimbo!<br>Dual wield any of the 30+ different weapons, creating wacky weapon combinations that fit your play-style perfectly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extend your arena!<br>Use credits to unlock different parts of the stage to get access to more weapons and resources!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolve!<br>Unlock stronger modifiers and weapons by earning XP from every run you make!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655290?t=1745925458","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/285f2c42f64630740eb632730b685d072b7c5911/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745925458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/373a5fc3995ec2433850f293ac1aecdf12b39588/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745925458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/373a5fc3995ec2433850f293ac1aecdf12b39588/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745925458","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"